    "html": "<p>A stone is thrown vertically upwards from the ground at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 0\"></span>. At <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 3.0\"></span> s and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 11\"></span> s the stone passes the same point above its starting position and then falls back to the ground. Air resistance is negligible. What is the total distance traveled by the stone?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"180\"></span> m</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"250\"></span> m</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"360\"></span> m</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"490\"></span> m</li>\n</ol>"
